#: patterns/product-faq.php:26
msgid "How do I track my order status?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/product-faq.php:26 patterns/product-faq.php:41
#: patterns/product-faq.php:55 patterns/product-faq.php:69
#: patterns/product-faq.php:83
msgid "+ "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/product-faq.php:31
msgid ""
"You can track your order status by logging into your account on our website and "
"visiting the My Orders section. There, you’ll find real-time updates on your "
"current and past orders.\n"
"                        You may also use the tracking link provided in your order "
"confirmation email for detailed shipment updates. "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/product-faq.php:41
msgid "Can I change or cancel my order? "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/product-faq.php:46
msgid ""
"Yes, you can change or cancel your order, but it depends on the order status and "
"store policy. In most cases, orders can be canceled from your account before they "
"are processed or shipped.  "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/product-faq.php:55
msgid "Can I order as a guest?  "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/product-faq.php:60
msgid ""
"Yes, you can place an order as a guest without creating an account. Simply "
"proceed to checkout and fill in your billing and shipping details. However, "
"creating an account allows you to track orders and manage your purchases easily. "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/product-faq.php:69
msgid "What is your return or exchange policy?  "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/product-faq.php:74
msgid ""
"We offer a customer-friendly return and exchange policy. If you’re not fully "
"satisfied with your purchase, you can request a return or exchange within the "
"specified return period. Please refer to our Returns Policy page for full "
"details. "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/product-faq.php:83
msgid "How long does shipping take?  "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/product-faq.php:88
msgid ""
"Shipping times vary depending on your location. Orders are typically processed "
"within a short timeframe, and delivery estimates are provided at checkout for "
"your convenience. "
msgstr ""

